SUMMARY:Kenny and Ziggy's Deli Month
DESCRIPTION:The 11th annual National Delicatessen Month returns Aug. 1-31. The deli month was founded in 2016 by Kenny & Ziggy’s New York Delicatessen & Restaurant. Continuing its tradition\, Kenny & Ziggy’s will be raising funds for Holocaust Museum Houston by offering a multi-choice\, three-course menu during lunch and dinner for $48 plus tax and gratuity. 10% of each meal sold will go to HMH\, providing funds for the museum’s education programs. Supporting the hard work our education team does has never been easier…or tastier!
URL:https://hmh.org/event/kenny-and-ziggys-deli-month/
LOCATION:Kenny and Ziggy’s – 1743 Post Oak Blvd.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://hmh.org/wp-content/uploads/bestKZlogoDELIBAKERYnolights20.webp
END:VEVENT
